OL,3,GNEWSAGreen councillor joins Labour
OL,4,Aafter Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Green councillor in Leicester has
OL,7,Fdefected to Labour, saying she no
OL,8,Flonger recognised her former party.
OL,10,FLiz Sahu, who has represented Castle
OL,11,Fward on Leicester City Council since
OL,12,F2023, said recent developments within
OL,13,Fthe Green Party, including its support
OL,14,Ffor a motion declaring "Zionism is
OL,15,Fracism", had led her to leave.
OL,17,FSahu's switch leaves the Greens with
OL,18,Fthree councillors on the Labour-run
OL,19,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
