OL,3,GNEWSAGreen councillor joins Labour
OL,4,Aafter Zionism motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted the Green Party
OL,7,Ffor comment but has not had a response.
OL,8,FA Green Party councillor said Sahu had
OL,9,Fbeen "unhappy" since she was deselected
OL,10,Fas a party candidate for the next city
OL,11,Fcouncil elections in May 2027.
